### Listar pessoas
GET http://localhost:1234/pessoa
Accept: application/json

### Consultar listas de constantes
GET http://localhost:1234/pessoa/enums
Accept: application/json

### Listar usuários
GET http://localhost:1234/usuario
Accept: application/json

### Listar autores
GET http://localhost:1234/autor/
Accept: application/json

### Listar atores
GET http://localhost:1234/ator
Accept: application/json

### Listar novelas
GET http://localhost:1234/novela
Accept: application/json

### Listar emissoras
GET http://localhost:1234/emissora
Accept: application/json

### Listar personagens
GET http://localhost:1234/personagem
Accept: application/json

### Listar versões de novelas
GET http://localhost:1234/versaoNovela
Accept: application/json

### Listar versões de personagens
GET http://localhost:1234/versaoPersonagem
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar autor
